#~ "appropriate for the new version of the software and, for sure,\n"
#~ "to suggest improvements in order to cover the new domains of the "
#~ "software.\n"
#~ "You join the Implementation Assistance department. This team of 3 people "
#~ "go with Odoo’s clients in the set up of the software. Your role will be\n"
